@startuml UseCase_E_MoveObjects
title Use Case E: 移動物件 (Move objects)

actor User
participant __anUMLEditor__ as UMLEditor
participant __aCanvas__ as Canvas
participant __aSelectMode__ as SelectMode
participant __aBasicObject__ as BasicObject
'participant __aPort__ as Port
participant __aConnectionLine__ as ConnectionLine

note over UMLEditor: Precondition: Select按鈕被按下
note top: 規格: 物件重疊時按照depth次序繪製\n最後選取的物件應被繪製於最上層

User -> Canvas ++ : 1. 在編輯區某物件(含composite)範圍內按下左鍵不放

Canvas -> SelectMode ++ : mousePressed(MouseEvent)
SelectMode -> Canvas ++ : getTopShapeAt(Point)
Canvas -> BasicObject ++ : 回傳被點擊的物件
BasicObject -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : 設置為被選取(若尚未選取)
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> Canvas ++ : floatToFront(BasicObject)
Canvas -->> SelectMode -- : return
note right of Canvas: 移到清單末端=視覺最上層,取代舊的 setDepth(0)
SelectMode -> SelectMode ++ : draggedShape = BasicObject\nstartPoint = 座標
SelectMode -->> SelectMode -- : return

User -> Canvas : 2. 不放開左鍵進行拖曳(drag)

Canvas -> SelectMode ++ : mouseDragged(MouseEvent)
SelectMode -> SelectMode ++ : draggedPort==null && draggedShape!=null
SelectMode -->> SelectMode -- : (檢查)
SelectMode -> SelectMode ++ : 計算dx = currentX - startPoint.x\ndy = currentY - startPoint.y
SelectMode -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : move(dx, dy)
BasicObject -> BasicObject ++ : x += dx; y += dy;
BasicObject -->> BasicObject -- : return
BasicObject -> BasicObject ++ : updatePorts()
BasicObject -->> BasicObject -- : return
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> BasicObject ++ : 所有Port位置已更新
BasicObject -->> SelectMode -- : (確認)
SelectMode -> Canvas : repaint()
SelectMode -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : 顯示移動中的圖形
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return

User -> Canvas : 3. 拖曳到座標x,y放開左鍵

Canvas -> SelectMode ++ : mouseReleased(MouseEvent)
SelectMode -> SelectMode ++ : 4. 物件被移動到新座標x,y
SelectMode -->> SelectMode -- : return
SelectMode -> Canvas : clearStates()
SelectMode -> Canvas : repaint()
SelectMode -->> Canvas -- : return

note right of Canvas: 5. 所有連結到該基本物件的\nconnection links全部重新繪製\n(因為Port位置已更新)\n連線會自動跟著Port移動

@enduml